+    """THE shared failure-accounting core (FIX-7, DESIGN C-5/§2.4): the
+    counter increment, limit resolution (per-task ``max_retries`` > caller
+    ``failure_limit`` > ``DEFAULT_FAILURE_LIMIT``), trip predicate, and
+    ``gave_up`` payload are implemented ONCE here and used by BOTH
+    :func:`_record_task_failure` (own-txn wrapper, dispatch callers) and
+    :func:`_record_task_failure_in_txn` (gate sequences, caller holds the
